export anchor Color:
    description:
        Sets the colour of the component's own text and text decorations. It does not pass down to child instances; a child that should share the colour must set it, or extend a component that does.

    identifier: color

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `color` property.

    values:
        - `<color>`

    initial: #000000

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            color: #dc2626
        \\\
        ```
